  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: survey of a fixture with Gemfile+Gemfile.lock (httparty) and composer.json (guzzle) stamps directness=None on all four ruby/php external_symbol nodes (summary direct:1 unknown:4). Only the composer.json dependency declaration node is stamped direct (INV-fuhin, 3c53837bb5). The npm control stamps axios boundary nodes direct. supply_chain.py LANGUAGE_PACKAGE_SCHEME is still {elixir, javascript, typescript}. MECHANISM: no manifest reader or package-name resolver for ruby/php schemes (LANGUAGE_PACKAGE_SCHEME / _SCHEME_RESOLVERS cover hex+npm only). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-hajag,WI-hotut."  # e2d5
